 OF KBR, INC. AND PDC ENERGY, INC. HE RECENTLY RETIRED AS A SENIOR GLOBAL PARTNER WITH DELOITTE & TOUCHE LLP WHERE HE HELD VARIOUS SENIOR LEADERSHIP AND OPERATIONAL ROLES, INCLUDING CEO FOR BOTH THE UNITED STATES AND GLOBAL AUDIT PRACTICES. WITH THIS APPOINTMENT, THE BOARD INCREASED ITS SIZE FROM NINE TO TEN MEMBERS."}{'symbol': 'VMC', 'date': '2022-07-08 16:30:00', 'title': 'VULCAN DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND ON COMMON STOCK', 'text': 'BIRMINGHAM, ALA. , JULY 8, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF VULCAN MATERIALS COMPANY (NYSE: VMC) TODAY DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.40 CENTS PER SHARE ON ITS COMMON STOCK.'}{'symbol': 'WM', 'date': '2022-07-08 19:42:00', 'title': 'WASTE MANAGEMENT, INC. (NYSE: WM) CLASS ACTION ALERT: BERNSTEIN LIEBHARD LLP REMINDS INVESTORS OF THE DEADLINE TO FILE A LEAD PLAINTIFF MOTION IN A SECURITIES CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST WASTE MANAGEMENT, INC. (NYSE: WM)', 'text': 'DID YOU LOSE MONEY ON INVESTMENTS IN WASTE MANAGEMENT? IF SO, PLEASE VISIT\xa0WASTE MANAGEMENT, INC. CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT\xa0OR CONTACT\xa0 PETER ALLOCCO AT (212) 951-2030\xa0OR\xa0PALLOCCO@BERNLIEB.COM\xa0TO DISCUSS YOUR RIGHTS.'}{'symbol': 'WM', 'date': '2022-07-08 05:45:00', 'title': 'WM SHAREHOLDER ALERT: JAKUBOWITZ LAW REMINDS WASTE MANAGEMENT SHAREHOLDERS OF A LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE OF AUGUST 8, 2022', 'text': 'NEW YORK , JULY 8, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- JAKUBOWITZ LAW ANNOUNCES THAT A SECURITIES FRAUD CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT HAS COMMENCED ON BEHALF OF SHAREHOLDERS OF WASTE MANAGEMENT, INC. (NYSE: WM). TO RECEIVE UPDATES ON THE LAWSUIT, FILL OUT THE FORM: HTTPS://CLAIMYOURLOSS.COM/SECURITIES/WASTE-MANAGEMENT-INC-LOSS-SUBMISSION-FORM/?ID=29614&FROM=4 THIS LAWSUIT IS ON BEHALF OF ALL PURCHASERS OF CERTAIN WASTE MANAGEMENT REDEEMABLE SENIOR NOTES BETWEEN FEBRUARY 13, 2020 AND JUNE 23, 2020.'}{'symbol': 'WFC', 'date': '2022-07-08 10:32:00', 'title': "WFC CLASS ACTION: HAGENS BERMAN, NATIONAL TRIAL ATTORNEYS, ENCOURAGES WELLS FARGO (WFC) INVESTORS WITH SIGNI